in c1b97000bcc7f975b17f3b0164a5396fa5767642 wallet/scan: combine block iteration and filtering in NextBlocksSerial

nit: in many places you use `QueuedBlock` and in others you use a pair of `{block_hash, block_height}`. I think you could just use `QueuedBlock` always as it represents the same pair.

