Now that S`canContext` holds the per-scan state, `LoopState` seems redundant.
`LoopState`'s fields can be moved into  `ScanContext`.
`UpdateProgress` and `UpdateTipIfChanged` can take `ctx`, like the other helpers.
That removes a struct and keeps all scan state in one place.

